{"id":"the-third-axiom","name":"The Third Axiom","type":"Pulse Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/86e9614811cd8560010c7398e300cad4.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/3744058588.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Slideways","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/531db7656c3f2ed054898e141d85b801.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts handling and stability."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Genesis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/087a911353a3586f5346a1cf88d8de05.png","desc":"Breaking a combatant's shield with this weapon fills its magazine from reserves. Energy weapons regenerate ammo on hit when matching the damage type to the combatant's shield."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Slideshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d41765e3db3a77da5cce27888c52d87.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts range and stability."},{"name":"Quickdraw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6893bb2c7ec7d13cb0d91ec9dd8b6500.png","desc":"This weapon can be drawn unbelievably fast."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Thresh","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7f9dcf3bd4a8a4e0d2d0922827f038c9.png","desc":"Killing combatants with this weapon generates a small amount of Super energy."},{"name":"Multikill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3749921a74a378259228d5e989459311.png","desc":"Reloading grants increased damage based on the number of rapid final blows made beforehand."},{"name":"Sympathetic Arsenal","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b744f4c74f1838c93a8eb63535b22a22.png","desc":"Reloading after a final blow also reloads stowed weapons."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","desc":"Precision kills create an elemental damage explosion."},{"name":"Disruption Break","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/45b57ce27fa0213218c7cb8f2253c517.png","desc":"Breaking an enemy's shield with this weapon makes them more vulnerable to Kinetic damage for a brief period."},{"name":"Opening Shot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/276e8ce23910c6ee2a6b88b076a2004c.png","desc":"Improved accuracy and range on the opening shot of attack."},{"name":"Headseeker","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bdca577f8850f3c6168e9bc055019934.png","desc":"Body shots landed with this weapon increase precision damage and aim assist for a short time. Body shots landed while the perk is active refresh the time."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."},{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Vanguard Determination","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0eac4566f9f8eb2179d2734e886f958e.png","desc":"After using your class ability, final blows with this weapon grant you bonus damage resistance."},{"name":"Vanguard's Vindication","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c7feebe5d55e4611c5d031d50eaca7ed.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant a small amount of health."}]}],"notes":["Inspired by @Saint_Kabr and @ImpetusAlways (PvE PvE-Utility PvE-Champion PvE-EndGame PvE-God M+KB Controller): First-choice PvE roll for piercing Barrier Champions in activities rated Very Hard, Hard or Normal difficulty. The Third Axiom is an Adaptive pulse rifle which as a subfamily are currently rated C-Tier for endgame PvE by @TheAegisRelic Endgame Analysis spreadsheet in https://www.destiny2.science/ as \"small step down from C tier pulse damage profile, but has barrier intrinsic\". The frame intrinsic offers no bonuses beyond being \"well-rounded, reliable and sturdy\", as per the https://www.destiny2.science/ Destiny Data Compendium. The stats are on the low side by comparison with its peers - you can see the stats at https://destiny.report/w/3744058588/the-third-axiom and hopefully https://d2foundry.gg/w/3744058588 will show how weapon stats impact in-game performance when the site is back up and running. The recoil is a little left and a bit loose, so to tighten that up, look for a barrel perk that helps with Recoil Direction or, if you can handle it just go for extra handling, and then with the magazine perk go for Armor-Piercing Rounds for the additional ×1.05 shield damage, one of the other cambat effect mags or something that helps improve magazine size or reload. This is, admittedly, a niche roll but if you pair Genesis in the first trait perk column, to refill the mag after breaking a shield or Slideways to refill 15% of the mag and boost Stability by +15 and Handling by +30 (+18 and +33 when enhanced) when you slide, with Disruption Break in the second column to increase kinetic damage by ×1.5 for 5.5s after breaking an elemental shield or barrier, you should be able to quickly finish off Barrier Champions from a safe distance with a kinetic special weapon. The Vanguard Determination origin trait provides up to ×3 stacks that reduces incoming damage to max ×0.94 for a refreshable 10s (12.5s when enhanced), on kills within 20s of using a class ability. If you're interested, in mathematics, the \"Third Axiom of Probability\" (the axiom of countable additivity) dictates how separate, mutually exclusive events function - this ties perfectly into the weapon's flavour text. Recommended MW: Handling, with your preferred choice of mod to boost weapon stats, ammo generation, or elemental pickups for builds.","[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Handling/Range] \"The Third Axiom is a decent pick. It's difficult to pin down a coherent roll given its 12 perks in each column, but if you get one that makes sense, it's fairly reliable for harder content. I've brought 390RPM Pulses into a few different GMs, and they always do fine. The benefit here being an elemental Pulse if you need one for Match Game - if you're not in need of that, you might find more success with 340RPMs like Messenger, simply for the Range benefits.\" tags:pve","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 205. PvP first choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 205. PvP backup roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 205. PvE backup roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns from Podcast 205. PvE first choice roll for pulse anti-barrier mods. Recommended MW: Stability.","File auto genera